{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25430","headline":"早秋龙兴寺江亭闲眺忆龙门山居寄崔张旧从事 · 李德裕","name":"早秋龙兴寺江亭闲眺忆龙门山居寄崔张旧从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江亭感秋至，兰径悲露泫。\n秔稻秀晚川，杉松郁晴巘。\n嗟予有林壑，兹夕念原衍。\n绿筱连岭多，青莎近溪浅。\n渊明菊犹在，仲蔚蒿莫翦。\n乔木粲凌苕，阴崖积幽藓。\n遥思伊川水，北渡龙门岘。\n苍翠双阙间，逶迤清滩转。\n故人在乡国，岁晏路悠缅。\n惆怅此生涯，无由共登践。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}